========================================================================================
                      LAB PRACTICALS PIN CONNECTION CHEAT SHEET
========================================================================================

PRACTICAL 1: LED BLINKING PATTERNS
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* LED 1 Anode (+)  --> Physical Pin 7  (GPIO 4)
* LED 2 Anode (+)  --> Physical Pin 11 (GPIO 17)
* LED 3 Anode (+)  --> Physical Pin 13 (GPIO 27)
* LED 4 Anode (+)  --> Physical Pin 15 (GPIO 22)
* All Cathodes (-) --> Physical Pin 9  (GND) via resistors

PRACTICAL 2: TELEGRAM BOT GPIO CONTROL
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Green LED (+)    --> Physical Pin 3  (GPIO 2)
* Yellow LED (+)   --> Physical Pin 5  (GPIO 3)
* Red LED (+)      --> Physical Pin 7  (GPIO 4)
* Blue LED (+)     --> Physical Pin 11 (GPIO 17)
* All Cathodes (-) --> Physical Pin 9  (GND) via resistors

PRACTICAL 3: TM1637 4-DIGIT 7-SEGMENT DISPLAY
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* VCC              --> Physical Pin 4  (5V)
* GND              --> Physical Pin 14 (GND)
* CLK              --> Physical Pin 16 (GPIO 23)
* DIO              --> Physical Pin 18 (GPIO 24)

PRACTICAL 7: RC522 RFID MODULE (SPI)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* 3.3V             --> Physical Pin 1  (3.3V Power - DO NOT CONNECT TO 5V)
* GND              --> Physical Pin 6  (GND)
* RST              --> Physical Pin 22 (GPIO 25)
* MISO             --> Physical Pin 21 (GPIO 9 / SPI0 MISO)
* MOSI             --> Physical Pin 19 (GPIO 10 / SPI0 MOSI)
* SCK              --> Physical Pin 23 (GPIO 11 / SPI0 SCLK)
* SDA / NSS / CS   --> Physical Pin 24 (GPIO 8 / SPI0 CE0)

PRACTICAL 11: R307 FINGERPRINT + 16x2 I2C LCD
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[I2C LCD]
* VCC              --> Physical Pin 2  (5V)
* GND              --> Physical Pin 6  (GND)
* SDA              --> Physical Pin 3  (GPIO 2 / I2C1 SDA)
* SCL              --> Physical Pin 5  (GPIO 3 / I2C1 SCL)
[Fingerprint Sensor]
* VCC (Red)        --> Physical Pin 4  (5V)
* GND (Black)      --> Physical Pin 9  (GND)
* TXD (Green)      --> Physical Pin 10 (GPIO 15 / UART RXD)
* RXD (White)      --> Physical Pin 8  (GPIO 14 / UART TXD)

PRACTICAL 12: FINGERPRINT SENSOR + RELAY (DOOR LOCK)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[Relay Module]
* VCC              --> Physical Pin 2  (5V)
* GND              --> Physical Pin 9  (GND)
* IN               --> Physical Pin 11 (GPIO 17)
[Fingerprint Sensor]
* VCC              --> Physical Pin 4  (5V)
* GND              --> Physical Pin 6  (GND)
* TXD              --> Physical Pin 10 (GPIO 15 / UART RXD)
* RXD              --> Physical Pin 8  (GPIO 14 / UART TXD)

PRACTICAL 13: MQTT LED CONTROL
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* LED Anode (+)    --> Physical Pin 12 (GPIO 18)
* LED Cathode (-)  --> Physical Pin 6  (GND) via resistor

PRACTICAL 14: FLASK WEB DASHBOARD RELAY
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Relay VCC        --> Physical Pin 2  (5V)
* Relay GND        --> Physical Pin 6  (GND)
* Relay IN         --> Physical Pin 11 (GPIO 17) or Pin 12 (GPIO 18)

PRACTICAL 18: CPU/RAM/TEMP MONITORING
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* No external hardware connections required (Internal software metrics).
